iew on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-12-20T09:41:48Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>zxx</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1737417105459249196":{"a":"<p>That moment you remember you were in the FDA trial for the life changing drug you are now taking. But couldn&#x27;t afford it once it was approved so you spent 33 years crippled without it. That 13yo boy is looking at you world and seeing all the other 13yo boys and girls you hurt.…</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1737417105459249196</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1737417105459249196\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-12-20T10:18:12Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1737420174968361414":{"a":"<p>My summary of 5 years living inside the healthcare system at a good hospital: Patient diagnostics and communications are completely incompetent. Younger doctors seem wizard but are using 1990s tech (Hyperspace) managed by FBI agents instead of experts.</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1737420174968361414</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1737420174968361414\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-12-20T10:30:24Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1737420968434278588":{"a":"<p>Take MRI analysis, Hyperspace shows MRIs as a slide show like aunt May forced you to watch in the 70s. Me, presumably nobody, is pointing out defects to my neurosurgeon using Open Source automated imaging diagnostics software on a 7yo medical workstation discarded into the trash.…</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1737420968434278588</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1737420968434278588\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-12-20T10:33:33Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1737421629951561914":{"a":"<p>How in the holy hell do you medical people expect a 70yo who is out of her mind to do this work for you. You have computers but are so frightened by the FBI agents wandering your halls to use them patients are being murdered.</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1737421629951561914</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1737421629951561914\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-12-20T10:36:10Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1737423096464756907":{"a":"<p>@Asher_Wolf My cousin spent months selling these pills to &quot;fix your brain.&quot; It works; I looked it up and it failed FDA trials because if you have a certain gene it causes your grey matter to denature. I pointed out our family has that gene. Too uneducated to get it. Mom had a stroke. 🤦‍♂️😿</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Asher_Wolf/status/1737407166565560339\">https://x.com/Asher_Wolf/status/1737407166565560339</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1737423096464756907</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1737423096464756907\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-12-20T10:42:00Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1737423526187929883":{"a":"<p>RT @MCHammer: Gold for Water ??? The timing must be impeccable. #Hamm400✨✍🏽 t.co</p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"1737423526187929883-GByQEA-bwAAHrsW.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1737423526187929883\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1737423526187929883</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1737423526187929883</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1737423526187929883\">Vie